{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Shred. Crush. Wash</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Recyclic is a (not so) cozy game about sorting hand-drawn pieces of garbage. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Try to keep on top of your living costs as company policy, government regulation, and personal requests quickly pile up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Cut. Label. Test</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Improve your workflow and upgrade your company issued equipment to make your job slightly less tedious. Pocket any valuables that end up on the line.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Peel. Separate. Sort</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fulfill special requests, perhaps a friendly favor, or something more... profitable. Bring life and color to an otherwise bleak world.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3601590?t=1743223259","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3601590?t=1743223259","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601590/410313e7853491baa0d9213a1661512e24c12bb7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743223259","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601590/410313e7853491baa0d9213a1661512e24c12bb7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743223259","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Shred. Crush. Wash</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Recyclic is a (not so) cozy game about sorting hand-drawn pieces of garbage. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Try to keep on top of your living costs as company policy, government regulation, and personal requests quickly pile up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Cut. Label. Test</strong></